<mjml>
  <mj-head>

    <mj-raw>
      <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
      <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
    </mj-raw>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#222222" />

      <mj-text line-height="1.6" font-size="16px" />
      <mj-class name="preheader" font-size="12px" color="#888888" text-transform="uppercase" letter-spacing="1px" />
      <mj-class name="heading" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="32px" line-height="1.2" font-style="italic" />
    </mj-attributes>

    <mj-style>
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      /* Main background and section backgrounds */
      .dark-bg, .dark-bg > table {
      background-color: #1a1a1a !important;
      }
      /* Secondary "beige" background for editorial cards */
      .dark-beige, .dark-beige > table {
      background-color: #2a2a2a !important;
      }
      /* This targets the card background specifically */
      .dark-card,
      .dark-card > table,
      .dark-card > table > tbody > tr > td {
      background-color: #121212 !important;
      }
      /* Text color overrides */
      .dark-text div, .dark-text a {
      color: #ffffff !important;
      }
      .dark-subtext div {
      color: #bbbbbb !important;
      }
      .card-link a {
      color: #ffffff !important;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #D52234 !important;
      }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#fcfaf7">
    <mj-section padding="10px 20px" background-color="#fcfaf7">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-text mj-class="preheader" align="center">Of tea, soup, castle and fires.</mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0" background-color="#ffffff" css-class="dark-bg">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-image src="https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExZzBsanoxZnAwOG5wemFvN2VjMGpqbDhybzJ2bWU0MG5kazlvYjExbSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/1Y7BhZmo3L3IsmnBK9/giphy.gif" padding="0" height='180px' />

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" css-class="dark-bg" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-text mj-class="heading" padding-bottom="30px" css-class="dark-text">Happy New Year, Friend</mj-text>

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text" align='left'>
          I hope you had a wonderful break and a gentle start to the new year.

          I spent my break with my in-laws in the UK and then celebrated my birthday (I'm 43, which is awesome as it's a prime number!) and New Year's Eve in one of my favourite places: the Chateau Coliving in Normandy, France.

          Yep, I returned for the 3rd time in one year, there's just something magical about this place, even (or especially in the depth of winter).

          Despite being sick with a nasty cold (and losing my voice after singing karaoke until 4 am on NYE 😂), it's been the perfect place to start the New Year, with lovely people, cosy fires, fun board games and lots and lots of tea.

          Of course, the world, big brands and the ever-powerful algorithm have been sending me the not-so-subtle message that it's time to hustle! To jump straight back into work, to hit the ground running...and all the usual nonsense. 🙄

          In the past, I got sucked into this so quickly, I'd have a tummy ache from anxiety before the first week of the year was even over. 🥺
        </mj-text>

        <mj-image src="https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/750/750358/images/c5344980a2f2c6a02826de23f8092394b1b8f925.gif" padding="30px 0" alt="New Year Illustration" width='300px' />

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text" padding-top="20px" align='left'>
          Thankfully, I've been working very hard on questioning this narrative, both personally as well as within DNG and our membership, The Lab (which just entered its 9th year, yaaaay!).

          And I'm definitely noticing a big shift in New Year's vibe, as many of us have been shedding layer upon layer of ingrained hustle culture and toxic productivity.

          We started the year in the Lab with our usual coworking sessions as well as some gentle, cosy events: Craft & Chat and Tea Time.

          January's Tea Time topic was Easing Into The Year and we all shared how we're arriving in this new year and what easing in means to us.

          I thought I'd share a few ideas and thoughts with you today:
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#fcfaf7" padding="40px 20px" css-class="dark-beige">
      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-text mj-class="preheader" align="center" padding-bottom="10px">The Winter Library</mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="center" font-size="28px" padding-bottom="30px" css-class="dark-text">Easing Into the Year</mj-text>

      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="48%" background-color="#ffffff" padding="10px" css-class="dark-card">

        <mj-image src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/meips/ADKq_NZgJOLzqNhjZHHZcHPB0BEXIvcE65jk_nLnxVkeQKkFKrmPFN1WEVhTQEf0SI3Eomf1_s4tQfeC1kyzj3munPWB5dEqs7nSLXGZ7ugd8LlIucshU17HJWe--HetR_o--0Fe2dsBu2tY-M2sCftnfQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/750/750358/images/e0f5e7b962ec4d22825e5e33d49fc0e5d3509dc5.gif" height="150px" padding="0" />

        <mj-text padding="20px 15px 10px" font-weight="bold" font-size="14px" css-class="dark-text">CASTLE MAINTENANCE</mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="0 15px 20px" font-size="13px" color="#555555" css-class="dark-subtext">Here at the Chateau, one of the most important maintenance activities is keeping the firewood chopped and stocked, so we can keep the cosy fire going all day. It's a slow, manual and very mindful task, and surprisingly enjoyable. 🪵

          Maintenance might feel less exciting than starting work on a shiny new idea, but it's just as important, if not more. Who knows, it might even save you a bunch of work in the future.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="0 15px 20px" css-class="card-link">
          <a href="#" style="color: #222222; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #D52234; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;" class="dark-text">What are some maintenance tasks you might like to dedicate some time to this winter? I'd love to hear about them! Hit reply!</a>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="4%">

      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="48%" background-color="#ffffff" padding="10px" css-class="dark-card">

        <mj-image src="https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/750/750358/images/5429582b5442f7f74ee204c1452f7a2cded8b71a.gif" height="150px" padding="0" />

        <mj-text padding="20px 15px 10px" font-weight="bold" font-size="14px" css-class="dark-text">A TIME TO SHRAPEN OUR TOOLS</mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="0 15px 20px" font-size="13px" color="#555555" css-class="dark-subtext">Our member Laura P. shared that January is a time for composting the old to allow new things to grow. It's a time to sharpen your tools 🪚, check the pantry stocks 🍯, or mend what's broken 🪡.I absolutely love this imagery, and it's a wonderful reminder that this time of year is great for maintenance, not so much for growth or exploration.</mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="0 15px 20px" css-class="card-link">
          <a href="#" style="color: #222222; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #D52234; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;" class="dark-text">BOOK NOW</a>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" css-class="dark-bg" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-text mj-class="preheader" font-size="14px" padding-bottom="10px">🏰 Join the FINAL Writers Haven at the Chateau Coliving next month (get €500 off with our code!)</mj-text>

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text">
          Last November, I was lucky enough to take part in the 2nd Writers Haven, and next month it's returning to the Chateau for <b>a third and final time!</b></mj-text>

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text">

          If you're a writer (no matter what kind of writing or if you get paid for it), then this is a magical experience that I can highly recommend and it's the last time it's being organised. </mj-text>

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text">
          It's not too late to sign up, and you can even <b>get €500 off with the code 'WRITEORDIE'.</b> </mj-text>

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text">
          My friend and Lab member Kristen will be hosting it, she's brilliant, funny, sweet and has great snacks!

          <a href="#" style="color:#222222; text-decoration:none; border-bottom:2px solid #D52234;" class="dark-text">Check out the details and book here.</a>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text css-class="dark-text" color="#888888" font-style='italic'>p.s. I mention the Chateau A LOT because I love it here. This is not a paid ad but a recommendation by a friend. </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#fcfaf7" padding="20px 20px 40px" css-class="dark-beige">
      <mj-column width="48%" background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px 15px" css-class="dark-card" border-top="4px solid #D52234">

        <mj-text font-weight="bold" font-size="16px" padding-bottom="10px" css-class="dark-text">
          👯‍♀️ IN THE LAB
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" css-class="dark-subtext">
          It's officially Cosy Season! Join our Planning Parties or the new 4-part workshop series on Joy & Purpose.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-top="15px">
          <a href="#" style="color: #D52234; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none;" class="dark-text">USE CODE: COSYSEASON25</a>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="4%">

      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="48%" background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px 15px" css-class="dark-card" border-top="4px solid #222222">

        <mj-text font-weight="bold" font-size="16px" padding-bottom="10px" css-class="dark-text">
          ✨ SPRINKLES
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" css-class="dark-subtext">
          Digital Detox Challenge this Sunday, plus 4 positive tipping points to start your year with hope.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-top="15px" css-class="card-link">
          <a href="#" style="color: #222222; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12px;" class="dark-text">READ MORE</a>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" css-class="dark-bg" padding="40px 20px"><mj-column>

        <mj-text mj-class="preheader" align="center" padding-bottom="10px">Until next time! Stay cosy!</mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="center" font-size="28px" padding-bottom="30px" css-class="dark-text">Jenny</mj-text>

      </mj-column></mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#f4f4f4" padding="40px 20px" css-class="dark-bg">
      <mj-column>

        <mj-text font-style="italic" font-size="14px" color="#555555" align="center" padding-bottom="20px" css-class="dark-subtext">
          Each week I share an honest glimpse of what it's really like to work location independently — beyond the passport stamps and "passive" income.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="14px" align="center" padding-bottom="40px" css-class="dark-text">
          If you enjoy this newsletter, please forward it to a friend! <br />
          Are you that friend? <a href="#" style="color: #222222; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;" class="dark-text">Then sign up here!</a> (and hi there! 👋)
        </mj-text>

        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#dddddd" />

        <mj-text font-size="11px" color="#888888" align="center" padding-top="30px" line-height="1.4">
          Digital Nomad Girls Ltd, Kemp House 160 City Road London, EC1V 2NX, London, UK
        </mj-text>

